Description: Kernora OS picture wallpapers
 Picture wallpapers for Kernora OS, sorted into collections such as Art,
 Earth, Landscapes, Life, Motif, Textures and Solid colours. Settings shows
 them under Wallpaper & style, and the Plasma wallpaper dialog lists them
 too. Some come with a dark variant that follows the dark theme.
